# UFW Firewall Configuration ###################################$
$
  [+] Firewall             Configured deny policy$
$
  ufw ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Installed            Yes$
  [+] Status               Active$
  [+] Incoming policy      Deny$
  [+] At boot              Yes$
$
  SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] [::]:22              Allowed$
  [+] 0.0.0.0:22           Allowed$
$
  Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] 22/tcp               Allow$
  [+] 22/tcp (v6)          Allow$
$
  Ports --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  22/tcp               Open$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable firewall     Stop ufw (not recommended)$
   2) Application Profiles Add, remove, apply$
   3) Trusted Interfaces   Add, remove, apply$
   5) Limit SSH            Block repeated connections$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-3, 5 or q]: 5$
$
  Checking the host...$
$
# Limit SSH ####################################################$
$
# Note$
# ufw refuses an address that opens 6 or more SSH connections in$
# 30 seconds, yours included.$
$
  Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] 22/tcp               Limit$
  [+] 22/tcp (v6)          Limit$
$
   -  Limit 22/tcp$
      ufw$
      -allow 22/tcp$
      +limit 22/tcp$
      $ ufw limit 22/tcp$
$
  Limit SSH? [y/N, 0 or q]: n$
$
